    "summary": "A rectangular bag.  Made of red, twill woven wool, with fine multicoloured bands (woven as stripes): orange/green, black/white, and pink/white.  The sides of the bag (the warp ends) are secured with a double row of white machine stitching, as is the top of the bag (the selvedges).  Two green loops are secured to the top of the bag through which is threaded a blue/pink plied woollen handle, ends knotted together.",
